{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n对导体棒动量定理，"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}l\\Delta Q=mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta Q=Q_{0}-Q=Q_{0}-CB_{0}lv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}l(Q_{0}-CB_{0}lv_{0})=mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=2\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）进入右侧磁场区域后，安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F=BIl"},{"type":"text","value":"，已知"},{"type":"math","value":"B=0.5x"},{"type":"text","value":"，安培力方向与 x 方向相反，则"},{"type":"math","value":"F=-0.2x"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"W=0-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n安培力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -0.1x_{m}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m} = 2\\sqrt{5}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)类比简谐运动"},{"type":"math","value":"F = -kx"},{"type":"text","value":"的周期公式"},{"type":"math","value":"T = 2\\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{T}{4} = \\frac{\\pi\\sqrt{5}}{2}s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）已知"},{"type":"math","value":"I = 0.4\\mathrm{A}, R = 4\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，代入"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = I^2 Rt"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 0.32\\pi \\sqrt{5} \\approx 2.25\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"【编校注】原印第（1）问末行的力的单位为 A，按安培力公式应为 N。"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--qiangji-lianmeng-2505-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--qiangji-lianmeng-2505","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2505-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9ff79c7227f9f856a3f2afe28c9442602bf3dec3e4bd247d1ed60e6d7299fc63","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(13分)如图所示,直线MN上方各处都有水平向右的匀强电场和垂直于纸面向里的匀强磁场,匀强电场的电场强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{4ql}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,MN下方未知的区域内存在匀强磁场,其磁感应强度大小和方向均与直线MN上方的磁场相同.放射性粒子源O沿与MN成 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 斜向下的方向持续发出大量质量为m、电荷量为+q的粒子,粒子沿直线运动 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\sqrt{3}l"},{"type":"text","value":" 的距离后从A点进入磁场(沿OA运动时,还未进入磁场),所有粒子速度大小在 "},{"type":"math","value":"(0\\sim v_{0})"},{"type":"text","value":" 范围内,经磁场偏转后所有粒子均垂直MN进入上方的区域.已知速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粒子离开A点后到达MN之前一直在磁场中运动,经过直线MN上的K点垂直MN进入上方区域.不计粒子的重力和粒子间的相互作用等影响,求:\n(1)MN 下方匀强磁场的磁感应强度；\n(2)速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粒子在MN下方运动的总时间；\n(3)MN 下方磁场区域的最小面积；\n(4)某时刻,速度分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 两个粒子同时通过MN进入上方区域,求这两个粒子在MN上方相距的最小距离.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/00ed7034f2bc0d27766d2d36e8321e4a297c682e34bce1dd82315f9b8db1b422.png","width":332,"height":220,"width_mm":38.929,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2505-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(13 分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{m v_{0}}{2ql}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(8\\sqrt{3}+\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)\\frac{l}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{\\min}=\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi-\\sqrt{3}\\right)l^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{l}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解:(1)作出速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子进入 MN 下方磁场的运动轨迹,如图所示.\n根据几何关系可得"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=2\\sqrt{3}l\\tan30^{\\circ}=2l"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n粒子在磁场中做匀速圆周运动,根据洛伦兹力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"Bqv_{0}=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{r_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{mv_{0}}{2ql}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/126efd458a9db24cf81c5d20b90de147fcad4afabd5c14d8888af8a148f63cd3.png","width":329,"height":168,"width_mm":41.6},{"type":"text","value":"(2)速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子在 MN 下方运动，磁场中的运动轨迹满足"},{"type":"math","value":"Bq\\frac{v_{0}}{3}=\\frac{m\\left(\\frac{v_{0}}{3}\\right)^{2}}{r_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2}=\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{mv_{0}}{Bq}=\\frac{1}{3}r_{1}=\\frac{2l}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知该粒子在"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"下方的运动分三段，即在"},{"type":"math","value":"OA"},{"type":"text","value":"段做匀速直线运动、在磁场中做匀速圆周运动，从磁场飞出后匀速直线运动，从直线"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"上的某点垂直"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"进入上方区域，如图所示."},{"type":"text","value":"设 OA 段运动时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，在 MN 下方某区域磁场做匀速圆周运动时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，从磁场飞出后运动时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_3"},{"type":"text","value":"，在 OA 段有"},{"type":"math","value":"2 \\sqrt {3} l = \\frac {v _ {0}}{3} t _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{6\\sqrt{3}l}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a114c7087d8c9d617cd4bb436ba9e8a3cf116f23b2a16286fc65c0b2e4871023.png","width":329,"height":163,"width_mm":41.6},{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"下方某区域磁场做匀速圆周运动，根据几何关系可知粒子偏转的圆心角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 120^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"则粒子在"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"下方某区域磁场中运动的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = \\frac{T}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"又"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi r_2}{\\frac{v_0}{3}} = \\frac{4\\pi l}{v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = \\frac{4\\pi l}{3v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）从磁场飞出后匀速直线运动有"},{"type":"math","value":"(r_1 - r_2)\\sin 60^\\circ = \\frac{v_0}{3} t_3"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_3 = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}l}{v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）故速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_0}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子在"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"下方运动的总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = t_1 + t_2 + t_3 = \\left(8\\sqrt{3} +\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)\\frac{l}{v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)由题分析,可知所有粒子在磁场中转过的圆心角为"},{"type":"math","value":"120^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，线段 AK 为磁场的上边界，如图所示。\nMN 下方磁场区域的最小面积"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{\\min} = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r_{1}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2}r_{1}^{2}\\sin 120^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{\\min}=\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi-\\sqrt{3}\\right)l^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ef16b6d578b7e9a9ccbbe6d663a8baa074c304a304f0c4703b5985bd92bfafa0.png","width":408,"height":129,"width_mm":51.6},{"type":"text","value":"(4) 方法一: 设两粒子经过直线 MN 的点之间的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"。根据几何关系，速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子半径为 l，速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子半径为 2l，故"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_{1}=2l-2l\\sin30^{\\circ}\\sin30^{\\circ}=\\frac{3l}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n两粒子在"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = \\Delta x_{1} - r_{3}(1 - \\cos \\omega t)"},{"type":"text","value":"，相对速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta v = v_0 - \\frac{v_0}{2} = \\frac{v_0}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"又"},{"type":"math","value":"Bq\\frac{v_0}{2} = \\frac{m\\frac{v_0^2}{4}}{r_3}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{3}=l"},{"type":"text","value":"两粒子在"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta y = r_3\\sin \\omega t"},{"type":"text","value":"设两粒子之间的距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"math","value":"(\\Delta x)^2 +(\\Delta y)^2 = d^2"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"d = \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{4} l^2 + l^2\\cos\\omega t}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e4a1eb4b85dd2d4eb122649ff857885566371582866db57e631dbeb8a882b8ef.png","width":467,"height":201,"width_mm":59.2},{"type":"text","value":"两粒子间距离的最小值"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\mathrm{min}} = \\frac{l}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n方法二:取速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子为参考系,在此参考系下,从K点进入的粒子做线速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速圆周运动,其位置关系如图所示.\n图中"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_0}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子的位置，则两粒子之间的最小距离为圆周上点到"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"的最小距离"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\mathrm{min}} = \\frac{l}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6a7be70526fa746a01d0d65e6124d392be890ae9f48144d438f3e69357d327cf.png","width":357,"height":327,"width_mm":45.2}]}}]}
